<problem>
<!-- <title>linear differential equation, initial value problem, write in</title> -->

<setup>

<selectFromSequence name="a" from="-10" to=" 10" step=" 0.1" exclude="0" />
<selectFromSequence name="b" from="-10" to=" 10" step=" 0.1" exclude="0" />
<selectFromSequence name="differential_notation" from="0" to=" 1" />
<select name="f_name">x y z s u v w</select>
<math name="diffeq">$a$f_name</math>
<math name="solution" simplify="full">$b *e^($a *t)</math>
<math name="solution2">$b/(e^(-1*$a *t))</math>
<selectFromSequence name="name_index" from="0" to="1" />

</setup>

<!--
<p>debug:  function name = <m>$f_name</m></p>
<p>debug:  coefficient on t, a = <m>$a</m></p>  
<p>debug:  coefficient on e, b = <m>$b</m></p>
<p>debug:  solution = <m>$solution</m></p>
<p>debug:  differential_notation = <m>$name_index</m></p>
<p>debug:  name_index= <m>$f_name</m></p>
<p>debug:  differential equation= <m>$diffeq</m></p>
<p>debug:  solution2= <m>$solution2</m></p>-->
  
<p>What is the solution to the following dynamical system?

<md>
<conditionalContent condition="$differential_notation=1">
  <mrow>\frac{ d$f_name }{ dt } \amp = $diffeq </mrow>
</conditionalContent>
<conditionalContent condition="$differential_notation=0">
  <mrow>$f_name '(t) \amp = $diffeq </mrow>
</conditionalContent>
<mrow>$f_name (0) \amp = $b </mrow></md>
</p>
<p>  
<m>
$f_name (t) = </m><answer>
<award symbolicEquality="true" simplifyOnCompare="true">$solution </award>
<award symbolicEquality="true" simplifyOnCompare="true">$solution2 </award>
</answer>
</p>


<solution>
The answer is <m>$f_name (t) =$solution </m>.

</solution>


</problem>